  "title": "Chive and Onion Yogurt and Cream Cheese Spread",
  "description": "A delicious, homemade version of the new yogurt and cream cheese spreads in the grocery store. If Greek yogurt is not available, hang your yogurt in a cheesecloth over the sink to drain overnight.",
